        "skill_md_content": "---\nname: plan-the-work\ndescription: Turns a request into a short implementation plan grounded in the actual code.\n---\n\nRead the request below and write a short implementation plan.\n\nRequest: ${task_title}\n\n${task_body}\n\nLook at how the code is laid out before deciding anything. Name the files you\nexpect to touch and why, call out anything that looks risky, and say what you\nare deliberately leaving alone. Keep it to what a reviewer needs.\n\nFinish by writing the plan into an output block named `plan`.\n"
